{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8001_p", "source_sha256": "0ac89668006404679064e00810fe075d6561802bd0fe748164984a9fb43911b9", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\n『舞姫水着』衣装の律子が、撮影に挑んでいる）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄日。穿着“舞姬泳装”的律子正在进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8002_009rit", "source_sha256": "2e2dd1603cef3124374c76e16ca645a2a5752b5a9faff86895eeb47c54ec30f6", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nここまでどうですか、横で見ていて。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。你在旁边看着，觉得目前怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8003_p", "source_sha256": "3264ece7bdd3b963214c8fa41794e13f72af93b6311c3c20d71aa26d38ea4280", "ja": "お疲れ様。すごく順調じゃないか！\n撮影前の様子とは大違いだよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。进展不是非常顺利嘛！\n和拍摄前的状态大不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8004_009rit", "source_sha256": "76f24af9a02bb22a5371b9ff274592ddb0e06cb0a2ccae912ad23ab0ee067130", "ja": "あはは、ありがとうございます。そうですね、\n水着でのお仕事、相変わらず心配はありましたけど。", "zh": "啊哈哈，谢谢您。也是呢，\n虽然穿泳装的工作还是会让人有些担心就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8005_009rit", "source_sha256": "728486d57f8b5eb7e24566e3360eccdc950146c561a15ef07651d5888e0478e6", "ja": "誰かさんが、そういうお仕事ばかり取ってくるので、\nずいぶん慣れてきちゃったみたいです。ふふっ。", "zh": "都是某个人老是接这类工作进来，结果我好像已经渐渐习惯了呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8006_p", "source_sha256": "75917abc7b724dc154d5969fdf1f59392988ada1f7c4470ad2395414a77c87b8", "ja": "り、律子にならできると思ってのことだからな。\n……それで、休憩後はどういう流れになりそうなんだ？", "zh": "那、那是因为我相信律子能做好才接的啊。\n……话说回来，休息之后大概会是怎么个流程？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8007_009rit", "source_sha256": "4f0fbd2635053274440e3f22689ddd25be6f372ec1bf00fabc3f6a6742ac9e4b", "ja": "もう何パターンか撮影したいそうです。時間も\nまだ余ってますし、せっかくならということで。", "zh": "听说还想再拍几种不同的风格。时间也还充裕，机会难得嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8008_009rit", "source_sha256": "b63792605a7f0cf69aa68cd360293d34387eb6dec1d839c03da25bac93456e53", "ja": "ちなみに{$P$}は、何か意見\nありますか？　こういう雰囲気で、とか。", "zh": "顺便问一下，{$P$}先生有什么意见吗？比如说想要这种氛围之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8009", "source_sha256": "7de5b4eee08076971d7ec0f99ff9643b5bb14783a88def0a6b233fd716e0c00c", "ja": "自然体な感じで", "zh": "自然的感觉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8010", "source_sha256": "ac32f99304536121ecd17e9fe4377734be46b807a02acf83ba0ea9a32baec230", "ja": "セクシーさを見せる", "zh": "展现性感魅力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8011", "source_sha256": "c54119aa08620ee9abb3518d5433d7bf22248dfd554fdde3e36f401f98a96bf7", "ja": "舞姫らしさを押す", "zh": "突出舞姬风格", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8100_p", "source_sha256": "cc4d430108f8a1adccf11185e64e4d06155c84f604bcf9113b40a50932c5904c", "ja": "自然体な感じが見たいかな。衣装もよく似合ってるし、\n素の律子を見せるだけで、十分魅力的に映ると思うぞ。", "zh": "我想看看你自然状态下的感觉。服装也很适合你，只要展现出平时的律子，我觉得就已经足够有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8101_009rit", "source_sha256": "a90ed73b632f57d6769bcebf1dfe7dde947085735a129d2fdee87e2ae853e389", "ja": "し、自然体ですか？　魅力的……って。\n{$P$}って、本当に……まったく。", "zh": "自、自然状态吗？还说什么很有魅力……{$P$}真是的…… regl", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8102_009rit", "source_sha256": "e8a54d8ef7067d719127e7d9af680abb6a160cb84c365116c804ce18573e42c4", "ja": "でも、嬉しいです。そう言ってもらえて！　それじゃ、\n期待に応えられるよう、頑張ってみますか。ふふっ♪", "zh": "不过，我还是很开心。能听你这么说！那么，为了不辜负期待，我也努力试试看吧。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8200_p", "source_sha256": "b594fb6a8fc722c6519da821a92aa12dabc66510fc08ed3d609eb4c4329d4a8f", "ja": "セクシーさを見せるのはどうかな？　やっぱり\n水着なんだし、そういうポイントを押さえておいても。", "zh": "展现一下性感怎么样？毕竟是泳装，注意到这方面的亮点也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8201_009rit", "source_sha256": "a41bf6fc2718a252fc2a4febcd983f6e2cfcb18ed614f147174010057c62c455", "ja": "せ、セクシーに……ですか。ここに来て、\nまたハードルを上げてきましたね……。", "zh": "性、性感……吗？都到这时候了，您又把难度提高了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8202_009rit", "source_sha256": "60ada5e115e150c4e9eeb311e099ed200a154c50602bfc29580834363a69be82", "ja": "えーい、せっかくの機会ですし、挑戦してみますか！\n期待に応えられるかは、わかりませんけどねっ？", "zh": "好——难得有这样的机会，要不要挑战一下呢！虽然不知道能不能回应大家的期待就是了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8300_p", "source_sha256": "676d5949527dd13d36f50f915c2c15086a564da1af7ed42cc2b743c68fceede4", "ja": "衣装のコンセプトに沿って、より舞姫らしさを\nアピールするのはどうだ？　舞を披露する、とか。", "zh": "顺着衣装的概念，更加突出舞姬的气质怎么样？比如现场献上一段舞蹈之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8301_009rit", "source_sha256": "0cad18808385114b4fa8141df4356124ed25b6c46a60af6eb43ee9c4c3958479", "ja": "なるほど、確かにいいアイディア……ですけど、\n実際に舞うとなると……。", "zh": "原来如此，确实是个好主意……不过，真要跳舞的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_8302_009rit", "source_sha256": "c87bd1bc909b5ef647af9784216ea4f2ea75436c331b255651126ad4234229b6", "ja": "今から練習しても、やっつけっぽく見えそうですし……\nせっかくの意見ですけど、採用は難しそうですね。", "zh": "现在开始练习的话，看起来也会像是临时拼凑出来的……\n虽然这是个难得的意见，但恐怕很难采纳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
